    "title": "Cristiano Ronaldo makes honest admission on dream of reaching 1,000 goals in 2026 World Cup final with Portugal - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Dante Gonzalez ,\n8 hours ago Cristiano Ronaldo continues to chase history even in the twilight of his career, with his goal tally climbing to 953 and counting. With the 2026 World Cup likely to be his final major tournament, the Portuguese superstar made an honest admission about the dream of scoring his 1,000th goal in the final with Portugal. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
